-### Bounded Defaults
-
-Defaults and hard caps must be runtime settings with strict schemas:
-
-| Limit | Default | Hard cap |
-|-------|---------|----------|
-| Concurrent workers | 2 | 8 |
-| Tasks per run | 12 | 32 |
-| Attempts per task | 2 | 5 |
-| Run duration | 2 hours | 24 hours |
-| Planner replans | 2 | 5 |
